Verse 1
[Bb]Anywhere with Jesus [Eb]I can safely [Bb]go, anywhere he leads me [C]in this world be[F]low;
[Bb]anywhere without him [Eb]dearest joys would [Bb]fade, anywhere with [F]Jesus I am [Bb]not afraid.

Chorus
[Bb]Anywhere, [F]anywhere! [Eb]Fear I [Bb]cannot know:
anywhere with [Eb]Jesus [Bb]I can [F]safely [Bb]go.
